<title>USA: Ampco-Pittsburgh Corp net rises for Q4, year.</title>
<headline>Ampco-Pittsburgh Corp net rises for Q4, year.</headline>
<text>
<p>PITTSBURGH, Jan 30 (Reuter)</p>
<p>				1996			1995</p>
<p> Shr			  $0.47		    $0.33</p>
<p> Net			  4,463		    3,189</p>
<p> Revs			42,040		   38,677</p>
<p>	  12 MONTHS</p>
<p> Shr			  $1.29		    $0.94</p>
<p> Net			 12,390		    9,050</p>
<p> Revs		     162,403		  143,785</p>
<p>(All data above 000s except per share numbers)</p>
<p>NOT0  Q4 and full-year 1996 results include gains of $485,000 and $519,000, respectively, from the sale of investments. The gains improved per share results by $0.05 for the quarter and the year.</p>
</text>
